ata-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"407\">De Nikon 1 S1 is een compacte systeemcamera die geschikt is voor fotografie en video met hogere kwaliteit dan een standaard compactcamera. Dankzij de verwisselbare lenzen en snelle autofocus is deze camera ideaal voor dagelijks gebruik, reizen en hobbyfotografie. Met de meegeleverde lenzen kun je zowel brede foto’s als ingezoomde opnames maken.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"435\"><strong data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"418\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"421\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"676\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"452\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"455\">⭐ Compacte systeemcamera met verwisselbare lenzen<br data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"507\">⭐ Inclusief standaardlens én telelens<br data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\">⭐ Snelle autofocus en gebruiksvriendelijke bediening<br data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"602\">⭐ Geschikt voor foto en video<br data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"634\">⭐ Lichtgewicht en eenvoudig mee te nemen</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"1060\">📋 <strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"698\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"701\"><strong data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"710\">Type:</strong> Systeemcamera<br data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"727\"><strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"737\">Model:</strong> Nikon 1 S1<br data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"751\"><strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"762\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Sensor:</strong> 10.1 Megapixel CMOS<br data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"785\"><strong data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"796\">Lens 1:</strong> Nikon 1 NIKKOR 11-27.5mm f/3.5-5.6<br data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"834\"><strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"845\">Lens 2:</strong> Nikon 1 NIKKOR VR 30-110mm f/3.8-5.6<br data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"885\"><strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"895\">Video:</strong> Full HD video-opname<br data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"919\"><strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"930\">Scherm:</strong> LCD-display<br data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\"><strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"964\">Connectiviteit:</strong> USB, HDMI<br data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"977\"><strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"989\">Voeding:</strong> Oplaadbare accu<br data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1008\"><strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1018\">Kleur:</strong> Wit / White<br data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1033\"><strong data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1043\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1183\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1080\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1083\">Nikon 1 S1 Camera<br data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1103\">Nikon 1 NIKKOR 11-27.5mm Lens<br data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1135\">Nikon 1 NIKKOR VR 30-110mm Lens<br data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1169\">Accu<br data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1176\">Lader</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1242\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1207\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1210\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<div class=\"contents\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
